  "description": "After a recent divorce, Seung-Gyu takes in an abandoned human–animal hybrid lingering outside his home, unable to ignore the quiet loneliness they share. As they begin living together, Seung-Gyu names him Samsam and tries to care for him properly, but their gentle cohabitation soon deepens into an intimate bond.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
